                <td style="width: 290.937px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Associated with antiphospholipid syndrome, pregnancy morbidity, arterial, venous thrombosis, thrombocytopenia, and hemolytic anemia</p></list-item></list>
</td>
